{"id":"n4-081","title":"～し、～し、～","romaji":"〜shi, 〜shi, 〜","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Express multiple reasons or characteristics; 'and', 'because', 'since'.","longExplanation":"The ～し、～し、～ grammar point is used to connect multiple reasons or characteristics that support a conclusion or statement. It can be translated as 'and', 'because', or 'since' in English. This grammar can be used with verbs, い-adjectives, な-adjectives, and nouns.","formation":"Verb-casual + し, い-Adjective + し, な-Adjective + だし, Noun + だし","examples":[{"jp":"彼は若いし、元気だし、フレンドリーだし、みんなと仲良くなれると思います。","romaji":"Kare wa wakai shi, genki da shi, furendorī da shi, minna to nakayoku nareru to omoimasu.","en":"He is young, energetic, friendly, and I think he can get along with everyone.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"若いし","vocabId":"1324300","reading":"わかいし","baseForm":"若い"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"元気","vocabId":"1260720","reading":"げんき"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"フレンドリー","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"みんな","vocabId":null},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"仲良く","vocabId":"1426090","reading":"なかよく"},{"surface":"なれる","vocabId":"1212670","reading":"なれる"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"思います","vocabId":"1589350","reading":"おもいます","baseForm":"思う"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2]},{"jp":"このレストランは料理が美味しいし、雰囲気がいいし、価格も手頃だからお勧めです。","romaji":"Kono resutoran wa ryouri ga oishii shi, fun'iki ga ii shi, kakaku mo tegoro dakara osusume desu.","en":"I recommend this restaurant because the food is delicious, the atmosphere is nice, and the prices are reasonable.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"レストラン","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"料理","vocabId":"1554310","reading":"りょうり"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"美味しいし","vocabId":"1486650","reading":"おいしいし","baseForm":"美味しい"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"雰囲気","vocabId":"1505070","reading":"ふんいき"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"価格","vocabId":"1189500","reading":"かかく"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"手頃","vocabId":"1327660","reading":"てごろ"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"から","vocabId":null},{"surface":"お","vocabId":null},{"surface":"勧めです","vocabId":"1595680","reading":"すすめです","baseForm":"勧める"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5]},{"jp":"彼女は勉強ができるし、スポーツも得意だし、性格もいい。","romaji":"Kanojo wa benkyou ga dekiru shi, supōtsu mo tokui da shi, seikaku mo ii.","en":"She is good at studying, good at sports, and has a good personality.","words":[{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"できる","vocabId":"1340450","reading":"できる"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"スポーツ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"得意","vocabId":"1454510","reading":"とくい"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"性格","vocabId":"1375290","reading":"せいかく"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いい","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5]},{"jp":"今日は寒いし、雨も降っているし、家でゆっくり休んだ方がいいでしょう。","romaji":"Kyou wa samui shi, ame mo futte iru shi, ie de yukkuri yasunda hou ga ii deshou.","en":"It's cold today, and it's raining, so it's better to relax at home.","words":[{"surface":"今日は","vocabId":"1289400","reading":"きょうは"},{"surface":"寒いし","vocabId":"1210360","reading":"さむいし","baseForm":"寒い"},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"雨","vocabId":"1171900","reading":"あめ"},{"surfac